<td><strong>Age</strong></td>
<td>26–35</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Occupation</strong></td>
<td>Works in IT, banking, government, or private sector</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Location</strong></td>
<td>Lives in Beltola, Six Mile, Zoo Road, or similar residential areas</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Income</strong></td>
<td>₹30,000–₹80,000/month</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Shopping Frequency</strong></td>
<td>Buys clothes 1–2 times/month</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Average Spend per Purchase</strong></td>
<td>₹800–₹2,500</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Current Behavior</strong></td>
<td>Shops on Myntra when planning ahead. Rushes to GS Road or a mall on weekends when urgent. Hates the commute and crowds.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
