<p><strong>Why Rohit uses ThreadIt:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Urgency. Pure urgency. No other platform can deliver clothes within 30 minutes.</li>
<li>This is ThreadIt&#39;s <strong>inarguable use case</strong> — where no alternative comes close</li>
<li>He&#39;ll pay premium delivery fees. He&#39;ll tip the rider. He just needs it NOW.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>What could stop Rohit:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>If we don&#39;t have the category he needs in stock nearby (formal wear, ethnic wear for festivals)</li>
