<blockquote>
<p>[!TIP]<br><strong>Rohit is our best marketing story.</strong> Every ad, every social media post, every launch campaign should evoke Rohit&#39;s situation. &quot;Need it in 30 minutes?&quot; is a clearer message than &quot;Shop from local stores online.&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
