<h2>Refund Processing</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Payment Method</th>
<th>Refund Timeline</th>
<th>Method</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>UPI</td>
<td>Instant (within 2 hours)</td>
<td>Refund to original UPI ID</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Debit Card</td>
<td>5–7 business days</td>
<td>Refund to card (bank processing time)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Credit Card</td>
<td>5–7 business days</td>
<td>Refund to card</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>COD</td>
<td>3–5 business days</td>
<td>Refund to UPI or bank account (customer provides)</td>
</tr>
