<hr>
<h1>Chapter 13 — Customer App</h1>
<h2>Design Philosophy</h2>
<p>The ThreadIt customer app must feel like <strong>Zomato meets Myntra</strong> — the speed and simplicity of a food delivery app with the visual appeal of a fashion app.</p>
<p><strong>Three design principles:</strong></p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Principle</th>
<th>What It Means</th>
<th>What To Avoid</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td><strong>Speed-first</strong></td>
<td>Every screen should remind the customer that this is FAST. Show delivery ETAs everywhere. Minimize taps to order.</td>
<td>Don&#39;t build a browsing-heavy experience like Myntra. Our customer knows roughly what they want.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Trust-forward</strong></td>
<td>Store name, rating, and distance visible on every product. The store is the trust anchor, not ThreadIt.</td>
<td>Don&#39;t hide the store identity behind a platform brand. We&#39;re not Amazon.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Simple-by-design</strong></td>
<td>Limited catalog is a feature, not a bug. Don&#39;t try to show 10,000 products. Show the right 50 products from nearby stores.</td>
<td>No infinite scroll. No endless categories. No feature bloat.</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<h2>Screen Inventory</h2>
<pre><code>CUSTOMER APP — SCREEN MAP

┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐
│  ONBOARDING  │────▶│    HOME      │────▶│   SEARCH /   │
│  (first run) │     │              │     │   BROWSE     │
└──────────────┘     └──────┬───────┘     └──────────────┘
                            │
                    ┌───────┴───────┐
                    │               │
              ┌─────┴─────┐   ┌────┴──────┐
              │   STORE   │   │  PRODUCT  │
              │   PAGE    │   │  DETAIL   │
              └─────┬─────┘   └────┬──────┘
                    │              │
                    └──────┬───────┘
                           │
                    ┌──────┴───────┐
                    │    CART      │
                    └──────┬───────┘
                           │
                    ┌──────┴───────┐
                    │  CHECKOUT    │
                    └──────┬───────┘
                           │
                    ┌──────┴───────┐
                    │   ORDER      │
                    │  TRACKING    │
                    └──────┬───────┘
                           │
                    ┌──────┴───────┐     ┌──────────────┐
                    │  PROFILE /   │     │    CHAT      │
                    │  ORDERS      │     │  (with store)│
                    └──────────────┘     └──────────────┘
</code></pre>
<h2>Screen 1: Onboarding (First Run Only)</h2>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Get location permission + phone auth. That&#39;s it. No tutorials, no carousels.</p>
<pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│                                 │
│        [ThreadIt Logo]          │
│                                 │
│   &quot;Get clothes from nearby      │
│    stores in 30 minutes&quot;        │
│                                 │
│   ┌───────────────────────┐     │
│   │  📍 Allow Location   │     │
│   └───────────────────────┘     │
│                                 │
│   We need your location to      │
│   show stores near you          │
│                                 │
│   ┌───────────────────────┐     │
│   │  📱 Continue with     │     │
│   │     Phone Number      │     │
│   └───────────────────────┘     │
│                                 │
│   OTP verification              │
│                                 │
└─────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Key decisions:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>No email signup. Phone number only. This is India — phone = identity.</li>
<li>No name required upfront. Collect it at first checkout (when we actually need a delivery name).</li>
<li>No skip option for location. Location is core to the product — it doesn&#39;t work without it.</li>
<li>Single screen, two taps: location permission → phone number → OTP → done.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Screen 2: Home Screen</h2>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> The home screen answers: &quot;What can I get delivered right now?&quot;</p>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│ 📍 Beltola, Guwahati    [▼]     │
│ Delivery in ~28 min              │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ 🔍 Search &quot;formal shirt&quot;... │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│                                  │
│ [Shirts] [Trousers] [T-Shirts]  │
│ [Kurtas] [Jeans] [All]          │
│                                  │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ NEARBY STORES                    │
│                                  │
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ 🏪 Raman Clothing           │ │
│ │ ⭐ 4.3 · 1.2 km · 25 min   │ │
│ │ Men&#39;s Formal &amp; Casual       │ │
│ │ [📷 📷 📷 📷] (product    │ │
│ │  preview thumbnails)        │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                  │
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ 🏪 Deepa&#39;s Boutique         │ │
│ │ ⭐ 4.7 · 0.8 km · 22 min   │ │
│ │ ✨ Top Rated                 │ │
│ │ Women&#39;s Western &amp; Ethnic    │ │
│ │ [📷 📷 📷 📷]             │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                  │
│ TRENDING NEARBY                  │
│ ┌────┐ ┌────┐ ┌────┐ ┌────┐    │
│ │    │ │    │ │    │ │    │    │
│ │ 📷 │ │ 📷 │ │ 📷 │ │ 📷 │    │
│ │₹799│ │₹599│ │₹1.2k││₹449│    │
│ │Shop│ │Shop│ │Shop │ │Shop│    │
│ └────┘ └────┘ └────┘ └────┘    │
│                                  │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│  🏠 Home  🔍 Search  🛒  👤    │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Key elements:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Location bar</strong> — Always visible. Customer must see that results are location-specific. Tappable to change address.</li>
<li><strong>Estimated delivery time</strong> — Global ETA at the top. Reinforces the speed promise immediately.</li>
<li><strong>Category chips</strong> — Quick filters. Not nested categories — flat, single-level. Tap &quot;Shirts&quot; to see all shirts from nearby stores.</li>
<li><strong>Nearby Stores section</strong> — Store cards with name, rating, distance, delivery estimate, and product preview thumbnails. Sorted by: distance first, then rating.</li>
<li><strong>Trending Nearby</strong> — Product grid showing popular items across stores. Each card shows product photo, price, and store name.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Key UX decision: Store-first, not product-first for the home screen.</strong></p>
<p>The home screen shows stores first (like Zomato shows restaurants), not products first (like Myntra shows clothes). Rationale:</p>
<ul>
<li>Store identity is our trust differentiator</li>
<li>Customers in Guwahati have existing store preferences</li>
<li>Store cards with product previews give a taste of the catalog without overwhelming</li>
<li>Category chips and search serve the &quot;product-first&quot; use case</li>
</ul>
<h2>Screen 3: Store Page</h2>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> The store&#39;s digital storefront. This is what Deepa shares on Instagram.</p>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│ ← Back                          │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │     [Store Banner Image]     │ │
│ │                              │ │
│ │   🏪 Deepa&#39;s Boutique       │ │
│ │   ⭐ 4.7 (128 ratings)      │ │
│ │   📍 1.2 km · Pan Bazaar    │ │
│ │   🕐 Open until 8:30 PM     │ │
│ │   ⚡ ~25 min delivery        │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                  │
│ [💬 Chat] [📞 Call] [❤ Save]    │
│                                  │
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
