│ │ [Trousers] [T-Shirts]       │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                  │
│ ┌────────────┐ ┌────────────┐   │
│ │   [Photo]  │ │   [Photo]  │   │
│ │ Blue Slim  │ │ Black Chino│   │
│ │ Fit Shirt  │ │ Trousers   │   │
│ │ ₹1,299     │ │ ₹899       │   │
│ │ S M L XL   │ │ 30 32 34   │   │
│ │ [Add ➕]   │ │ [Add ➕]   │   │
│ └────────────┘ └────────────┘   │
│                                  │
│ ┌────────────┐ ┌────────────┐   │
│ │   [Photo]  │ │   [Photo]  │   │
│ │ White      │ │ Nehru      │   │
│ │ Formal     │ │ Jacket     │   │
│ │ ₹1,599     │ │ ₹2,199     │   │
│ │ M L XL     │ │ M L XL     │   │
│ │ [Add ➕]   │ │ [Add ➕]   │   │
│ └────────────┘ └────────────┘   │
│                                  │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│      [🛒 View Cart (2 items)]   │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Key elements:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Store banner + branding</strong> — This is the vendor&#39;s space. Their name, their identity. For Deepa-type vendors, we can use their Instagram banner.</li>
<li><strong>Rating + distance + delivery time</strong> — Trust signals upfront</li>
<li><strong>Chat and Call buttons</strong> — Meera persona needs this to ask &quot;What size for my 4-year-old?&quot;</li>
<li><strong>Category tabs</strong> — Filter within this store&#39;s catalog</li>
<li><strong>Product cards</strong> — Photo, name, price, available sizes. The &quot;Add&quot; button goes directly to cart (size selection in a bottom sheet popup).</li>
<li><strong>Sticky cart bar</strong> — When items are in cart, show persistent cart bar at bottom</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>UX decision: Quick-add from store page vs. going to product detail.</strong></p>
<p>For fast commerce, we allow adding to cart directly from the store page via a bottom-sheet size selector. The product detail page is optional — for customers who want more information. This reduces taps: browse → select size → add to cart → checkout can be 4 taps total.</p>
<h2>Screen 4: Product Detail</h2>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Detailed view for customers who want more information before buying.</p>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│ ← Back                    [❤]   │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │                              │ │
