│ by Deepa&#39;s Boutique             │
│ ₹1,299                          │
│ (MRP ₹1,499 — 13% off)         │
│                                  │
│ SIZE                             │
│ ┌───┐ ┌───┐ ┌───┐ ┌───┐       │
│ │ S │ │ M │ │ L │ │XL │       │
│ └───┘ └───┘ └───┘ └───┘       │
│                                  │
│ 📏 Size Guide                    │
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ Chest: 40&quot;  Waist: —        │ │
│ │ Length: 28&quot;  Sleeve: 24&quot;    │ │
│ │ Fit: Slim                    │ │
│ │ &quot;This brand runs true to     │ │
│ │  size&quot; — based on 12 orders │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                  │
│ DETAILS                          │
│ • Fabric: 100% Cotton            │
│ • Color: Navy Blue               │
│ • Pattern: Solid                 │
│ • Occasion: Formal / Smart       │
│   Casual                         │
│                                  │
│ STORE INFO                       │
│ 🏪 Deepa&#39;s Boutique             │
│ ⭐ 4.7 · 📍 1.2 km              │
│ ⚡ Delivers in ~25 min           │
│                                  │
│ RETURN POLICY                    │
│ 📦 24-hour returns · Free        │
│    exchange in 48 hours          │
│                                  │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│  [🛒 Add to Cart — ₹1,299]      │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Key elements:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Photo carousel</strong> — 3 photos minimum (front, back, detail). Swipeable.</li>
<li><strong>Actual measurements</strong> — Not just S/M/L. Real measurements in inches/cm. This is how we reduce size-related returns.</li>
<li><strong>Size guide with fit intelligence</strong> — &quot;This brand runs true to size&quot; or &quot;Runs small — consider ordering one size up.&quot; Based on accumulated return data. In v1, this is manually entered. In v2, it&#39;s data-driven.</li>
<li><strong>Store info prominently displayed</strong> — The customer should always know which store this is from.</li>
<li><strong>Return policy on every product page</strong> — Transparency builds confidence to purchase.</li>
<li><strong>Sticky &quot;Add to Cart&quot; button</strong> — Always visible, always tappable.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Screen 5: Cart</h2>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│ ← Cart            [🗑 Clear]    │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│                                  │
│ 🏪 Ordering from: Deepa&#39;s       │
│    Boutique (1.2 km away)       │
│                                  │
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ [📷] Blue Slim Fit Shirt    │ │
│ │      Size: L                 │ │
│ │      ₹1,299         [- 1 +] │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                  │
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ [📷] Black Chino Trousers   │ │
│ │      Size: 32                │ │
│ │      ₹899           [- 1 +] │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                  │
│ ──────────────────────────────── │
│ Subtotal              ₹2,198    │
│ Delivery Fee          FREE ✨   │
│ (Free above ₹999)               │
│ ──────────────────────────────── │
│ Total                 ₹2,198    │
│                                  │
│ ⚡ Estimated delivery: 25 min   │
│                                  │
│ 💬 Add note to store (optional) │
│ &quot;Please include a carry bag&quot;     │
│                                  │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│  [Proceed to Checkout — ₹2,198] │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Key elements:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Store name at top</strong> — Reinforces single-store cart. &quot;You&#39;re ordering from THIS store.&quot;</li>
<li><strong>Free delivery indicator</strong> — If above ₹999, show &quot;FREE ✨&quot; prominently. If below, show delivery fee AND &quot;Add ₹X more for free delivery&quot; as a nudge.</li>
<li><strong>Delivery ETA</strong> — Always visible. Speed is the product.</li>
<li><strong>Note to store</strong> — Optional free-text. Customers may want to say &quot;gift wrap please&quot; or &quot;include a carry bag.&quot;</li>
<li><strong>No coupon code field in v1</strong> — We don&#39;t have a coupon system yet. Adding an empty coupon field creates expectations we can&#39;t meet.</li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p>[!NOTE]<br><strong>The &quot;Add ₹X more for free delivery&quot; nudge is a powerful AOV lever.</strong> If delivery threshold is ₹999 and customer has ₹750 in cart, showing &quot;Add ₹249 more for free delivery&quot; encourages adding one more item. This directly improves unit economics.</p>
</blockquote>
<h2>Screen 6: Checkout</h2>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│ ← Checkout                       │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│                                  │
│ DELIVERY ADDRESS                 │
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ 📍 Home                      │ │
│ │ 123, ABC Colony, Beltola     │ │
│ │ Guwahati, 781028             │ │
│ │                   [Change]   │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                  │
│ DELIVERY NAME                    │
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ Arjun Sharma                 │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                  │
│ DELIVERY PHONE                   │
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ +91 98765 43210 (auto-fill)  │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                  │
│ PAYMENT                          │
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ ◉ UPI (GPay, PhonePe,       │ │
│ │       Paytm)                 │ │
│ │ ○ Debit / Credit Card        │ │
│ │ ○ Cash on Delivery           │ │
│ │   (2+ orders required)      │ │
│ └──────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                  │
│ ORDER SUMMARY                    │
│ ┌──────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ Items (2)          ₹2,198   │ │
│ │ Delivery Fee       FREE     │ │
