</code></pre>
<p><strong>Key decisions:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>UPI as default selection</strong> — Highest adoption in India, lowest friction, instant refund capability.</li>
<li><strong>COD grayed out for new users</strong> — Shows the option exists but explains why it&#39;s not available (&quot;Complete 2 orders to unlock COD&quot;). This is better than hiding it entirely.</li>
<li><strong>&quot;After store confirms&quot; disclaimer</strong> — Managing expectations. The 30-minute clock starts at vendor confirmation, not at order placement. Be transparent.</li>
<li><strong>Address auto-fill from GPS</strong> — First order requires manual address entry. Subsequent orders use saved addresses.</li>
</ul>
