<p><strong>Key elements:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>5-step progress tracker</strong> — Clear visual of where the order is. Each step shows timestamp.</li>
<li><strong>Live map</strong> — Shows rider location relative to store and customer. In v1.1 (not MVP — MVP has status updates only).</li>
<li><strong>Rider info</strong> — Name, rating, call/message buttons. Customer can contact rider directly for address clarification.</li>
<li><strong>Order summary</strong> — What you ordered, from where, total amount.</li>
<li><strong>&quot;Need Help?&quot; link</strong> — Opens WhatsApp with pre-filled order ID.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Push notification strategy for order tracking:</strong></p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Event</th>
<th>Notification Text</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Order placed</td>
