</tr>
<tr>
<td>Picked up</td>
<td>&quot;📦 Your order is picked up and on the way!&quot;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Near delivery</td>
<td>&quot;🏠 [Rider Name] is almost there! Be ready.&quot;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Delivered</td>
<td>&quot;✅ Delivered! Rate your experience.&quot;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Vendor rejected</td>
<td>&quot;😞 [Store Name] couldn&#39;t fulfill your order. [Reason]. Refund initiated.&quot;</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<h2>Screen 8: Chat with Store</h2>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│ ← Deepa&#39;s Boutique  [📞 Call]   │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│                                  │
│            [Today, 7:05 PM]      │
│                                  │
│                    ┌───────────┐ │
│                    │ Hi! Do you│ │
│                    │ have the  │ │
│                    │ blue shirt│ │
│                    │ in XL?    │ │
│                    └───────────┘ │
│ ┌──────────────┐                │
│ │ Yes! XL is   │                │
│ │ available.   │                │
│ │ Shall I      │                │
│ │ keep one     │                │
│ │ aside?       │                │
│ └──────────────┘                │
│                    ┌───────────┐ │
│                    │ Yes please│ │
│                    │ ordering  │ │
│                    │ now!      │ │
│                    └───────────┘ │
│                                  │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ [Type a message...    ] [Send]   │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Key decisions:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Simple text chat only in v1.</strong> No image sharing, no voice notes. Keep it light.</li>
<li><strong>Chat is per-store, not per-order.</strong> Customer can message a store before placing an order (to check availability) or after (to discuss an issue).</li>
<li><strong>Store sees chats in their vendor app.</strong> Vendor can reply during active hours. Outside hours, show &quot;Store is currently closed. They&#39;ll reply when they open.&quot;</li>
<li><strong>Chat is NOT a replacement for support.</strong> Order issues go through the Help flow (WhatsApp), not store chat. Store chat is for product questions and personal interactions.</li>
</ul>
