<p><strong>This is the product-first view.</strong> When a customer searches by keyword or category, they see products from multiple stores — each clearly attributed to its store with distance and delivery ETA.</p>
<p><strong>Sort options:</strong> Nearest (default), Price: Low to High, Price: High to Low, Rating</p>
<p><strong>Filter options (v1):</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Size (S, M, L, XL, or numeric sizes)</li>
<li>Price range (₹0–₹500, ₹500–₹1000, ₹1000–₹2000, ₹2000+)</li>
<li>Store rating (4+ stars)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Filter options NOT in v1:</strong> Brand, color, fabric, occasion — these require structured product data that our catalog won&#39;t have consistently in the early phase.</p>
