│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐              │
│  │  ORDER ALERT │  │    CHAT     │              │
│  │ (full-screen) │  │             │              │
│  └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘              │
│                                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<h2>Screen 1: Dashboard (Home)</h2>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│  🏪 Deepa&#39;s Boutique            │
│  🟢 Online · Open until 8:30 PM │
│  ┌────────────────────────────┐  │
│  │  [🔴 GO OFFLINE]          │  │
│  └────────────────────────────┘  │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│                                  │
│  TODAY&#39;S SUMMARY                 │
│  ┌────────┐ ┌────────┐ ┌──────┐ │
│  │   12   │ │ ₹8,450 │ │  2   │ │
│  │ Orders │ │Earnings│ │Pending│ │
│  └────────┘ └────────┘ └──────┘ │
│                                  │
│  PENDING ORDERS                  │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────┐│
│  │ ⏳ Order #TH-2851            ││
│  │ 2 items · ₹1,899            ││
│  │ Waiting for pickup           ││
│  │ [View Details →]             ││
│  └──────────────────────────────┘│
│                                  │
│  RECENT ACTIVITY                 │
│  ✅ #TH-2850 delivered (6:45 PM)│
│  ✅ #TH-2849 delivered (6:12 PM)│
│  ❌ #TH-2848 rejected (5:55 PM) │
│                                  │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│  🏠 Home  📋 Orders  📦 Catalog │
│                     💰 Earnings  │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Key elements:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Online/Offline toggle</strong> — BIG, prominent button. One tap to go offline (stop receiving orders). Red when online (&quot;Go Offline&quot;), green when offline (&quot;Go Online&quot;). Color seems counterintuitive but matches mental model: red = action/stop.</li>
<li><strong>Today&#39;s summary</strong> — Three big numbers: orders completed, earnings, pending orders. This is what the vendor cares about.</li>
<li><strong>Pending orders</strong> — Any orders currently being processed. Quick access.</li>
<li><strong>4-tab navigation</strong> — Home, Orders, Catalog, Earnings. No more.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Screen 2: Order Alert (CRITICAL)</h2>
<p>This is the <strong>most important screen in the entire system.</strong> When a new order arrives, this screen takes over everything.</p>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│                                  │
│          🔔 NEW ORDER!           │
│                                  │
│     ┌─────────────────────┐      │
│     │   ⏱ 2:47 remaining │      │
│     │   ████████░░░░░░░░░ │      │
│     └─────────────────────┘      │
│                                  │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────┐│
│  │ ORDER #TH-2852               ││
│  │                              ││
│  │ 1x Blue Slim Fit Shirt (L)  ││
│  │ 1x Black Chino Trousers (32)││
│  │                              ││
│  │ Total: ₹2,198               ││
│  └──────────────────────────────┘│
│                                  │
│  Customer: Arjun S.              │
│  📍 Beltola (2.3 km away)       │
│                                  │
│                                  │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────┐│
│  │                              ││
│  │    ✅ ACCEPT ORDER           ││
│  │                              ││
│  └──────────────────────────────┘│
│                                  │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────┐│
│  │    ❌ Reject                  ││
│  └──────────────────────────────┘│
│                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────┘

🔊 [LOUD ALARM SOUND PLAYING]
📳 [PHONE VIBRATING]
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Critical design decisions:</strong></p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Decision</th>
<th>Rationale</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td><strong>Full-screen takeover</strong></td>
<td>Cannot be missed. Even if the vendor is in another app, this pops up as a high-priority notification.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Countdown timer</strong></td>
<td>3 minutes. Visual countdown creates urgency. When &lt; 30 seconds, timer turns red and pulses.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>ACCEPT button is 3x larger than reject</strong></td>
<td>Default action should be the easy action. Accept = big green button. Reject = small text link.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Loud alarm sound</strong></td>
<td>Not a notification chime — a distinct alarm sound that cuts through store noise (talking, traffic, music). Different from WhatsApp/SMS sounds.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Item details visible</strong></td>
<td>Vendor can see WHAT was ordered before accepting. This lets them mentally check if they have it.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Customer distance shown</strong></td>
<td>Vendor can see how far the customer is — gives context on delivery feasibility.</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<blockquote>
<p>[!WARNING]<br><strong>If the vendor&#39;s phone is on silent/DND:</strong> The app should still try to play the alarm sound. On Android, we can request notification channel priority to bypass DND. If sound fails, SMS backup is sent at the 1-minute mark, and an automated phone call at the 2-minute mark. <strong>Triple redundancy: push notification → SMS → phone call.</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<h2>Screen 3: Order Management</h2>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│  📋 Orders                       │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│  [Active (2)] [History] [Rejected]│
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│                                  │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────┐│
│  │ ORDER #TH-2852               ││
│  │ 2 items · ₹2,198            ││
│  │ Status: PACKING              ││
│  │                              ││
│  │ 1x Blue Slim Fit Shirt (L)  ││
│  │ 1x Black Chino Trousers (32)││
│  │                              ││
│  │ ┌──────────────────────────┐ ││
│  │ │  📦 READY FOR PICKUP    │ ││
│  │ └──────────────────────────┘ ││
│  │                              ││
│  │ [⚠ Can&#39;t find an item?]     ││
│  └──────────────────────────────┘│
│                                  │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────┐│
│  │ ORDER #TH-2851               ││
│  │ 1 item · ₹899               ││
│  │ Status: WAITING FOR RIDER   ││
│  │ Rider arriving in ~3 min    ││
│  └──────────────────────────────┘│
│                                  │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│  🏠 Home  📋 Orders  📦 Catalog │
│                     💰 Earnings  │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Key elements:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>&quot;Ready for Pickup&quot; button</strong> — BIG, obvious. One tap. This triggers rider dispatch to the store.</li>
<li><strong>&quot;Can&#39;t find an item?&quot; link</strong> — For the edge case where vendor accepted but then can&#39;t locate the product. This triggers the &quot;Packing Issue&quot; flow (partial fulfillment or cancellation).</li>
<li><strong>Tabs</strong> — Active orders, History (completed), Rejected. Simple.</li>
<li><strong>No &quot;In Transit&quot; or &quot;Delivered&quot; details</strong> — Vendor doesn&#39;t need to know rider location or delivery status. Their job ends at &quot;Ready for Pickup.&quot;</li>
</ul>
<h2>Screen 4: Catalog</h2>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│  📦 My Products (47 listed)      │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│  [All] [In Stock: 42] [Out: 5]  │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│                                  │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────┐│
│  │ [📷] Blue Slim Fit Shirt    ││
│  │      S ✅  M ✅  L ✅  XL ✅  ││
│  │      ₹1,299                  ││
│  │      ──────────── [🟢 ON]   ││
│  └──────────────────────────────┘│
│                                  │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────┐│
│  │ [📷] Black Chino Trousers   ││
│  │      30 ✅  32 ✅  34 ❌  36 ✅││
│  │      ₹899                    ││
│  │      ──────────── [🟢 ON]   ││
│  └──────────────────────────────┘│
