<p><strong>Key feature: One-tap stock toggle.</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Product-level toggle</strong> — Green (ON) = listed and available. Red (OFF) = hidden from customers. One tap to switch.</li>
<li><strong>Size-level toggle (v1.1)</strong> — Tap individual sizes to mark as available/unavailable. In v1, toggle is product-level only. In v1.1, vendors can mark &quot;Size 34 is out of stock&quot; without removing the whole product.</li>
<li><strong>No editing capability in v1</strong> — Vendors cannot change photos, prices, or descriptions. All catalog changes go through the ThreadIt team (field agent or admin dashboard). This prevents vendors from uploading poor quality photos or incorrect information.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Screen 5: Earnings</h2>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│  💰 Earnings                     │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│  [Today] [This Week] [This Month]│
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│                                  │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────┐│
│  │     ₹8,450                   ││
│  │     Today&#39;s Earnings          ││
│  │                              ││
