│                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Key elements:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Big earnings number</strong> — The single most motivating thing for a vendor. Show it prominently.</li>
<li><strong>Commission transparency</strong> — Show &quot;You earned ₹8,450 | Commission paid: ₹1,490&quot;. Transparency builds trust.</li>
<li><strong>Next payout info</strong> — When, how much, which bank account. Eliminates &quot;where&#39;s my money?&quot; support calls.</li>
<li><strong>Per-order breakdown</strong> — Each order showing: customer paid → vendor receives. Simple math the vendor can verify.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Screen 6–8: Settings, Chat, Store Profile</h2>
<p>These are simpler screens:</p>
<p><strong>Settings:</strong> Operating hours, bank account details, notification preferences, help/support contact.</p>
<p><strong>Chat:</strong> Same as customer chat but from vendor&#39;s perspective. Shows all customer conversations. Unread count badge on tab.</p>
<p><strong>Store Profile:</strong> View-only in v1 — store name, address, banner image, description. &quot;Contact ThreadIt to update&quot; link for any changes.</p>
<hr>
<h1>Chapter 15 — Delivery Partner App</h1>
<h2>v1 Strategy: WhatsApp-Based (No Native App)</h2>
<p>As established in Chapters 6 and 12, we&#39;re starting with a hybrid rider model — a few dedicated riders plus third-party partners. For v1, building a full native rider app is over-engineering.</p>
<p><strong>v1 rider communication flow:</strong></p>
<pre><code>ORDER CONFIRMED BY VENDOR
    │
    ▼
SYSTEM SENDS WHATSAPP MESSAGE TO NEAREST AVAILABLE RIDER:

&quot;🛵 New ThreadIt Delivery!

📦 Order #TH-2852
📍 Pickup: Deepa&#39;s Boutique, Pan Bazaar
   [Google Maps Link]
📍 Deliver to: 123 ABC Colony, Beltola
   [Google Maps Link]

💰 Payout: ₹45

Items: 2 (clothing — light package)

Reply YES to accept (auto-rejects in 2 min)&quot;
    │
    ├── Rider replies &quot;YES&quot; → Assigned
    │   │
    │   ▼
    │   &quot;✅ You&#39;re assigned! Head to the store.
    │    Pickup OTP: 4721
    │    Call store: [phone number]&quot;
    │   │
    │   ▼ (after pickup)
    │   Rider sends WhatsApp: &quot;PICKED UP&quot;
    │   │
    │   ▼
    │   &quot;📦 Great! Head to customer.
    │    Delivery OTP: 8834
    │    Call customer: [phone number]&quot;
    │   │
    │   ▼ (after delivery)
    │   Rider sends WhatsApp: &quot;DELIVERED&quot;
    │   │
    │   ▼
    │   &quot;✅ Delivery complete! ₹45 credited.
    │    Today&#39;s total: ₹320 (7 deliveries)&quot;
    │
    └── No reply in 2 min → Next rider gets the message
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Why WhatsApp works for v1:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Every rider already has WhatsApp</li>
<li>No app installation, no onboarding, no training</li>
<li>Google Maps links work natively</li>
<li>Reply-based confirmation is simple</li>
<li>We can start with 3–5 riders tomorrow without any app development</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Why WhatsApp won&#39;t work at scale:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>No real-time location tracking (we don&#39;t know where the rider is)</li>
<li>Manual message processing if multiple orders come simultaneously</li>
<li>No automation — each message requires manual trigger or bot setup</li>
<li>Can&#39;t do batched deliveries or smart routing</li>
<li>No earnings dashboard or history for riders</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Transition trigger:</strong> When we hit <strong>20+ orders/day consistently</strong>, build the native rider app.</p>
<h2>v1.1 Native Rider App — Specification</h2>
<p>When we transition to a native app, here are the screens:</p>
<h3>Screen 1: Availability Toggle</h3>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│                                  │
│         ThreadIt Rider           │
│                                  │
│      ┌────────────────────┐      │
│      │                    │      │
│      │    🟢 ONLINE       │      │
│      │                    │      │
│      │   [Tap to go       │      │
│      │    offline]        │      │
│      │                    │      │
│      └────────────────────┘      │
│                                  │
│  Today: 5 deliveries · ₹240     │
│                                  │
│  ⏳ Waiting for next delivery... │
│                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<p>Simple. One giant button. Online = receiving delivery requests. Offline = not.</p>
<h3>Screen 2: Delivery Request</h3>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│                                  │
│    🔔 NEW DELIVERY REQUEST       │
│                                  │
│    ⏱ Accept in 1:45             │
│                                  │
│  📍 Pickup: Deepa&#39;s Boutique    │
│     Pan Bazaar (0.8 km away)    │
│                                  │
│  📍 Deliver: Beltola            │
│     (2.3 km from store)         │
│                                  │
│  📦 Items: 2 (light)             │
│  💰 Payout: ₹45                 │
│                                  │
│  Estimated time: 25 min          │
│                                  │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────┐│
│  │     ✅ ACCEPT                 ││
│  └──────────────────────────────┘│
│                                  │
│  [Skip this one]                 │
│                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Key information for rider&#39;s decision:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>How far is the store from current location (affects time/fuel to get there)</li>
<li>How far is the delivery from the store (total trip distance)</li>
<li>Payout amount</li>
<li>Package weight/size indicator</li>
</ul>
<h3>Screen 3: Active Delivery — Navigation</h3>
<pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│  Step 1 of 2: Head to Store      │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│                                  │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────┐│
│  │                              ││
│  │     [Google Maps             ││
│  │      Navigation              ││
│  │      Embedded/Link]          ││
│  │                              ││
│  └──────────────────────────────┘│
│                                  │
│  🏪 Deepa&#39;s Boutique            │
│  📞 [Call Store]                 │
│                                  │
│  Pickup OTP: 4721                │
│                                  │
