<p><strong>Key design elements:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Kanban-style board</strong> — Orders move left to right through states. Each card shows order ID, store, time in current state.</li>
<li><strong>Color-coded alerts</strong> — Yellow (warning: approaching SLA), Red (SLA breached). Numbers auto-update.</li>
<li><strong>Action buttons on every alert</strong> — Don&#39;t just show the problem; provide the solution. &quot;Call Rider,&quot; &quot;Auto-reject,&quot; &quot;Refund&quot; — one click.</li>
<li><strong>Timer on each order</strong> — Shows how long the order has been in its current state. Makes SLA breaches visible at a glance.</li>
<li><strong>Browser notifications</strong> — When an order enters alert status, browser sends a desktop notification even if the dashboard tab is in background.</li>
</ul>
