<ul>
<li><strong>Photo upload</strong> — Drag and drop or file select. Auto-resize and optimize.</li>
<li><strong>Measurements</strong> — Mandatory fields for chest, waist, length. This is how we reduce size-related returns.</li>
<li><strong>Bulk upload (v1.1)</strong> — CSV template for adding many products at once. Speeds up onboarding for large stores.</li>
</ul>
