<td><strong>₹1,00,000–₹1,60,000</strong></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p><strong>Orders needed to cover fixed costs:</strong></p>
<p>₹1,30,000 (avg fixed) ÷ ₹131 (contribution margin/order) = <strong>~993 orders/month = ~33 orders/day</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>[!TIP]<br><strong>33 orders/day to cover fixed costs is achievable.</strong> But this assumes zero marketing spend. With marketing included (₹30,000–₹60,000/month), we need ~55–80 orders/day. Target: <strong>100+ orders/day by Month 4</strong> for healthy operations.</p>
</blockquote>
