<h1>Chapter 23 — Scaling Strategy</h1>
<h2>Scaling Phases</h2>
<pre><code>PHASE 1: DEEP (Month 0-6)
&quot;Win Guwahati. Prove the model.&quot;

PHASE 2: WIDE (Month 6-12)
&quot;Expand to 2-3 Northeast cities.&quot;

PHASE 3: NATIONAL (Month 12-24)
&quot;Enter Tier-2 cities across India.&quot;
</code></pre>
<h2>Phase 1: Deep — Saturate Guwahati</h2>
<h3>Zone Expansion Triggers</h3>
<p>Do NOT open Zone 2 until Zone 1 hits these metrics:</p>
