<td>25%</td>
<td>Concentrated shopping areas (like Fancy Bazaar)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Zomato/Swiggy penetration</strong></td>
<td>20%</td>
<td>Proves gig economy behavior exists in the city</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Founder/team connection</strong></td>
<td>15%</td>
<td>Do we know people who can help with vendor onboarding?</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Distance from Guwahati</strong></td>
<td>10%</td>
<td>Easier to manage ops for nearby cities</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Competition</strong></td>
